### sysext install --help
NAME:
   kairos-agent sysext install - Install a system extension

USAGE:
   install [--catalog URL]... [--version VERSION] URI|NAME

DESCRIPTION:
   Install a system extension from a URI or catalog

OPTIONS:
   --catalog extensions.catalogs [ --catalog extensions.catalogs ]  Extension catalog URL, repeatable. Searched in order, the first catalog publishing the name wins. Defaults to extensions.catalogs from the cloud config.
   --version value                                                  Extension version from the catalog. An exact version, or a semver constraint such as ">= 2.1, < 3"
   --help, -h                                                       show help
exit=0

